{
  "hooks": ["Go on. I'll keep the light."],
  "lines": [
    {
      "bar": 1,
      "beat": 1.0,
      "duration": 6.0,
      "section": "VERSE1",
      "text": "Hold it dry. I'll do the pour."
    },
    {
      "bar": 3,
      "beat": 1.0,
      "duration": 6.0,
      "section": "VERSE1",
      "text": "Stone in the road where the frost tore"
    },
    {
      "bar": 5,
      "beat": 1.0,
      "duration": 6.0,
      "section": "VERSE1",
      "text": "The house we built is leaning nigh, and let it groan"
    },
    {
      "bar": 7,
      "beat": 1.0,
      "duration": 6.0,
      "section": "VERSE1",
      "text": "Some knots I never learned to tie"
    },
    {
      "bar": 9,
      "beat": 2.0,
      "duration": 5.0,
      "section": "PRECHORUS1",
      "text": "Bags by the step, and the taxi's late"
    },
    {
      "bar": 11,
      "beat": 1.0,
      "duration": 6.0,
      "section": "CHORUS1",
      "text": "Go on. I'll keep the light."
    },
    {
      "bar": 13,
      "beat": 1.5,
      "duration": 5.5,
      "section": "FALSE_ENDING1",
      "text": "And that was the last of it. Nearly."
    },
    {
      "bar": 15,
      "beat": 2.0,
      "duration": 5.0,
      "section": "PRECHORUS2",
      "text": "You turn at the corner. You always turn."
    },
    {
      "bar": 17,
      "beat": 1.0,
      "duration": 6.0,
      "section": "CHORUS2",
      "text": "Go on. I'll keep the light."
    },
    {
      "bar": 19,
      "beat": 1.5,
      "duration": 5.5,
      "section": "TAG1",
      "text": "I have nothing else to spare"
    },
    {
      "bar": 21,
      "beat": 1.5,
      "duration": 5.5,
      "section": "TAG1",
      "text": "Take the coat. It cost me nothing."
    },
    {
      "bar": 23,
      "beat": 1.5,
      "duration": 5.5,
      "section": "TAG1",
      "text": "You crossed the yard and stood at the stair"
    },
    {
      "bar": 25,
      "beat": 2.0,
      "duration": 5.0,
      "section": "PRECHORUS3",
      "text": "The engine turning over in the dark"
    },
    {
      "bar": 27,
      "beat": 1.0,
      "duration": 6.0,
      "section": "CHORUS3",
      "text": "Go on. I'll keep the light."
    },
    {
      "bar": 29,
      "beat": 1.5,
      "duration": 5.5,
      "section": "POSTCHORUS1",
      "text": "Ache holds the doorframe, hear my plea"
    },
    {
      "bar": 31,
      "beat": 1.5,
      "duration": 5.5,
      "section": "POSTCHORUS1",
      "text": "Red light, quake in the glass, down to the quay"
    },
    {
      "bar": 33,
      "beat": 1.5,
      "duration": 5.5,
      "section": "POSTCHORUS1",
      "text": "Thread the tree line down to the stake"
    },
    {
      "bar": 35,
      "beat": 1.0,
      "duration": 6.0,
      "section": "CODA1",
      "text": "And the light stays on all night."
    }
  ],
